 R meetings follow on 11/12–18. The buyback was a decision disclosed 11/3
 \, not a completed purchase. I found no company announcement of the date\,
  so this rests on press reports.\n출처: https://daily.hankooki.com/news/
 articleView.html?idxno=1419674\n\n자동 생성: 모닝브리프 팩트체
